# The browser-test harness is dev-only and its dependencies are not installed
# here — the build stage copies four workspace manifests and this is not one of
# them. Without this, `COPY . .` drags the workspace in anyway and
# `npm run typecheck --workspaces` finds one whose `@playwright/test` does not
# exist, failing the image build for a package the image does not ship.
packages/e2e
